/AccountModal.tsx
Purpose: Phase D — optional cloud-account panel (mirrors ConnectModal/LibraryModal's {isOpen,onClose,connectionId} shape). Logged-out: a single "Log in" button (gameSso.startLogin, which opens a POPUP — never navigates this window, so the game connection survives; the button shows a waiting state and the panel updates itself when the popup lands). Logged-in: save/load this connection's scripts+plugins to/from the cloud (via useAccountModal.ts) and log out. Never gates any existing functionality — logged out remains the default, fully-supported state.
